💰 Real-World Project Cost Analysis: CampaignOS
Date: December 18, 2025 Prepared By: Farhan Ahmad (Lead Developer) Project Type: AI Sales Automation System

1. Executive Summary
CampaignOS utilizes a loosely coupled, serverless architecture. This ensures that fixed monthly costs are extremely low, with the majority of expenses tied directly to usage (variable OpEx).

Unlike legacy CRM systems that charge $100+ per user/month regardless of activity, CampaignOS costs scale linearly with your outreach volume.

