5. ROI Case Study: "The 500 Lead Campaign"
Scenario: You have a list of 500 leads. You want to email all 500 and call the 200 who open the email.

Option A: Manual Human SDR

Time: 500 Emails (5 mins each) + 200 Calls (10 mins each) = ~75 Hours.

Cost: 75 Hours @ $20/hr = $1,500.00.

Option B: CampaignOS (Automated)

Fixed Costs: $31.15 (Monthly subscription).

Email Cost: $0.09 (500 emails via GPT-4o-mini).

Voice Cost: $76.80 (200 calls * 3 mins * $0.128/min).

Total Cost: $108.04.

🚀 Final Verdict
CampaignOS delivers the same output for $108 that would cost $1,500 in human labor.

Savings: $1,391.96 per campaign.

Speed: 75 Hours of work condensed into ~2 Hours of machine time.
